      "abstract": "Most agencies and professional services firms don't have a tools problem. They have a tools-that-don't-talk-to-each-other problem. A CRM holds the contact. A project tool holds the task. A spreadsheet holds the RAG status, updated once a month by whoever remembers. None of them holds the relationship.",
